Package: capivara
Type: Package
Title: Decomposition and Analysis of IFU Data Cubes
Version: 0.4.4.9000
Imports: digest, FITSio, dplyr, fastcluster, ggplot2, gridExtra, matrixStats, patchwork, readr, reshape2, RANN, Rcpp, scales, spectropath, tidyr, viridis, yaml
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: reticulate, Matrix, torch, EBImage, imager, knitr, minpack.lm, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Remotes:
    RafaelSdeSouza/spectropath
Author: Rafael S. de Souza
Maintainer: Rafael S. de Souza <rd23aag@herts.ac.uk>
Description: The 'capivara' package provides tools for spectral segmentation
    and analysis of Integral Field Unit (IFU) data cubes. It includes explicit
    semantic flux and spectral-shape representations, an observed-entry
    spatial Ward hierarchy, historical exact and sparse-Ward backends,
    Sagui-style white-light starlet masks,
    variance-aware cluster summaries, and signal-to-noise-guided component
    selection for astronomy workflows.
